# Trivy ignore list — per-CVE suppressions for the image scan.
# Rules: one CVE id per line, ALWAYS with a trailing comment stating WHY and an
# expiry date. Review on every dependency bump. Empty = nothing suppressed
# (HIGH+CRITICAL with an available fix will block the build — that's intended).
#
# Format:
#   CVE-2025-XXXXX  # reason; re-check after <date>
